-- data/benchmarks/agda-algebras-v0/gold/agda-algebras-v0-gold.agda-lib
-- Project file for the gold fixtures, so any tool that resolves the nearest
-- .agda-lib (editors via agda-mode, agda-mcp's check_file, a bare `agda`
-- given only --library-file) can type-check a gold in isolation.  The twin
-- obligations directory carries its own project file: the two directories
-- hold modules with identical top-level names, so they must never share one
-- library (a shared include would make every module name ambiguous).
-- The depend names resolve against a libraries file that registers them;
-- inside the dev shell that is the repo's agda/libraries, written by the
-- shellHook (standard-library and agda-dojang always; agda-algebras from the
-- flake-pinned store copy, or a live checkout via AGDA_ALGEBRAS_ROOT).
name: agda-algebras-v0-gold
include: .
depend: standard-library agda-dojang agda-algebras
